# Environments
# .env.* as well as .env: the Settings page writes .env.tmp while saving, and a
# hand-made .env.backup or .env.local holds exactly the same real keys the plain
# name does. Only the committed template is exempt.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv
env/
venv/
